gate: OPEN
sprint: S90
title: Automated tests for the mobile app, config-app harness
priority: P1
dep: S89

description: |
  navitrack-mobile-apps has no tests. Copy the navitrack-config-app
  harness, not its product tests: Vitest + happy-dom + Testing Library
  colocated as src/**/*.test.ts(x), MSW for HTTP, Playwright in e2e/.
  Package manager stays pnpm.

  Branch test-coverage-oct-2026 from bug-fix-oct-2026 so S89 behavior
  is what the tests lock. Do not commit this work to main.

  Three layers, same as config-app:
  - unit tests beside pure modules and stores
  - component tests for every screen
  - e2e smoke of the logged-in journeys
  Leaflet tiles are not asserted. Map behavior is tested through pure
  helpers and mocked map components.

ground_truth:
  - navitrack/navitrack-config-app/vite.config.ts
  - navitrack/navitrack-config-app/src/test/setup.ts
  - navitrack/navitrack-config-app/playwright.config.ts
  - navitrack/navitrack-mobile-apps/vite.config.ts
  - navitrack/navitrack-mobile-apps/package.json

success_metrics:
  - pnpm test runs the colocated suite and exits 0.
  - pnpm test:e2e runs the Playwright journeys and exits 0.
  - Every screen under src/screens has a component test.
  - S89 rules are OPEN: threshold save, history 00:00, push lines,
    coincident-cluster helper, CAN rows when keys exist.

risks:
  - vite.config.ts throws when VITE_API_BASE is missing. Vitest loads that file.
  - happy-dom has no real Leaflet map. Do not render live tiles in unit tests.
  - Playwright must log in against MSW or a seeded session, not a live fleet.

invariants: sprints/73/S73-INVARIANTS.md
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, QA]
estimated: 4–6 days

tracks:
  - id: T0
    title: Branch and harness
    tasks:
      - S90-T0-branch-and-harness.pd
    requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]
    gate: OPEN

  - id: T1
    title: Pure modules and S89 rules
    tasks:
      - S90-T1-lib-unit-tests.pd
      - S90-T2-s89-rule-tests.pd
    requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]
    gate: OPEN

  - id: T2
    title: Stores and API
    tasks:
      - S90-T3-store-tests.pd
      - S90-T4-api-msw-tests.pd
    requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]
    gate: OPEN

  - id: T3
